<title>INDIA: SOCCER-NEHRU GOLD CUP RESULT/STANDINGS.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-NEHRU GOLD CUP RESULT/STANDINGS.</headline>
<dateline>COCHIN, India 1997-04-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Result of a preliminary league match in the five-nation Nehru Gold Cup soccer tournament on Tuesday:</p>
<p> India     2	Ghana     2   (halftime 1-1)</p>
<p>Scorers:</p>
<p>India - I.M. Vijayan 11, Bhaichung Bhutia 54</p>
<p>Ghana - Alex Donkar 37, Abedi Tugah 80</p>
<p>Final league standings:</p>
<p>		 P  W  D  L  F    A  Pts</p>
<p> Iraq	  4  4  0  0  10   1  12</p>
<p> Uzbekistan  4  1  2  1   7  11   5</p>
<p> India	 4  0  3  1   4   5   3</p>
<p> China	 4  0  3  1   1   3   3</p>
<p> Ghana	 4  0  2  2   4   6   2</p>
<p>Semifinal line-up: Iraq v India, Uzbekistan v China.</p>
</text>
